@startuml UC-02-Register
title Sequence Diagram: Register

actor "Users\n(calon Learner/Creator)" as User
participant "Halaman Register\n(React)" as UI
participant "POST /api/auth/register" as API
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Pengguna)" as DB
participant "Google Auth" as Google

== Flow Normal - Register Manual ==

User -> UI: Membuka halaman registrasi
activate UI
UI --> User: Menampilkan form register
User -> UI: Mengisi form (nama, email, password)\ndan klik "Daftar"
UI -> UI: Validasi client-side\n(format email, password >= 8 char)

alt Validasi lokal berhasil
    UI -> API: POST { namaLengkap, email, password }
    activate API
    API -> Controller: register()
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: registerUser(data)
    activate Service
    Service -> Service: Validasi server-side
    
    alt Format valid
        Service -> Service: Hash password (bcrypt)
        Service -> DB: SELECT email FROM Akun\nWHERE email = '[email]'
        activate DB
        DB --> Service: Return hasil pengecekan
        deactivate DB
        
        alt Email belum terdaftar
            Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
            activate DB
            Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Pengguna\n(namaLengkap, email, passwordHash,\nxpLearner=0, xpCreator=0,\ntotalXP=0, statusAktif=true)
            DB --> Service: Return idPengguna baru
            Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
            DB --> Service: Transaction success
            deactivate DB
            Service --> Controller: { success: true }
            Controller --> API: Response 201 Created
            API --> UI: Response sukses
            UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Registrasi berhasil!"
            UI --> User: Redirect ke halaman login
        else Email sudah terdaftar
            Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Email sudah digunakan" }
            Controller --> API: Response 409 Conflict
            API --> UI: Error response
            UI --> User: Tampilkan error\n"Email sudah digunakan"
        end
        
    else Format tidak valid
        Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Format tidak valid" }
        Controller --> API: Response 400 Bad Request
        API --> UI: Error response
        UI --> User: Tampilkan error validasi
    end
    
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    
else Validasi client gagal
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error validasi\ndi form
end

deactivate UI

== Flow Alternatif - Register via Google Auth ==

User -> UI: Klik "Daftar via Google"
activate UI
UI -> Google: Redirect ke Google Auth
activate Google
Google --> User: Halaman login Google
User -> Google: Authorize akun Google
Google --> UI: Return token & profil\n(nama, email)
deactivate Google

UI -> API: POST /api/auth/google-register\ndengan token
activate API
API -> Controller: googleRegister()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: registerViaGoogle(token)
activate Service
Service -> Service: Verify Google token\ndan ekstrak profil
Service -> DB: SELECT email FROM Akun\nWHERE email = '[google_email]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return hasil pengecekan
deactivate DB

alt Email belum terdaftar
    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Pengguna\n(namaLengkap, email, googleId,\nxpLearner=0, xpCreator=0,\ntotalXP=0, statusAktif=true)
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Return idPengguna baru
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: Generate JWT token
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, token, user }
    Controller --> API: Response 201 Created
    API --> UI: Response sukses dengan token
    UI -> UI: Simpan token ke localStorage
    UI --> User: Redirect langsung ke Home
else Email sudah terdaftar
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Email sudah digunakan" }
    Controller --> API: Response 409 Conflict
    API --> UI: Error response
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Exceptional Flow - Database Error ==

note over DB
  Jika INSERT gagal,
  sistem akan ROLLBACK transaction
  dan menampilkan error message
end note

@enduml
